---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import AffiliateLink from "../../components/AffiliateLink.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Ratchet & Clank: Rift Apart — PS5 Buying Guide"
  description="Ratchet & Clank: Rift Apart buying guide: why it's a PS5 showcase, editions, and where to buy the digital version cheapest."
>
  <article class="post">
    <h1>Ratchet &amp; Clank: Rift Apart — PS5 Buying Guide</h1>
    <p class="meta">PlayStation 5 · Updated 2026-08-05</p>

    <p>
      <strong>Ratchet &amp; Clank: Rift Apart</strong> is Insomniac's dimension-hopping
      platformer and one of the best showcases of the PS5's SSD speed, with near-instant
      world-jumping and gorgeous visuals.
    </p>

    <h2>What you get</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Full campaign</strong> — a tight, polished 10–15 hour adventure</li>
      <li><strong>Photomode and accessibility options</strong> — unusually robust for a platformer</li>
      <li><strong>Digital vs physical</strong> — digital is convenient and frequently discounted on key stores</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Where to buy cheapest</h2>
    <p>
      Rift Apart sees frequent Green Man Gaming price drops well below the PlayStation
      Store. If you want a family-friendly PS5 exclusive that looks amazing, the digital
      key is the smart buy.
    </p>

    <ul class="buy-list">
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="gmg"
          href="https://www.greenmangaming.com/search/?q=ratchet+and+clank+rift+apart+ps5"
          cta="Check Green Man Gaming"
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="amazon"
          href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Ratchet+and+Clank+Rift+Apart+PS5"
          cta="Check on Amazon"
        />
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="note">
      Prices change frequently — always verify on the store before purchasing.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .post { padding: 1.5rem 0; max-width: 720px; }
  .post h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
  .meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .buy-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
</style>
